Upstream code was run for verification (maintainer authorisation,
2026-10-07): the tests execute Zotero's schema SQL verbatim. Test fixtures
copied verbatim into tests/data/zotero/ (AGPL-3.0, same copyright):
system.sql, userdata.sql, triggers.sql (resource/schema/) and itemJSON.json
(test/tests/data/itemJSON.js, identical to kovan-common's copy).

Each ported file carries a header naming its upstream file(s) and commit.

Dependency added with it: rusqlite (MIT) with SQLite (public domain)
compiled in through libsqlite3-sys (MIT), native desktop targets only.
